Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Industria prelucrătoare
PREH ROMANIA - famous supplier of car components, which produces multifunctional switches for steering wheel and central command and control elements for the automotive industry (BMW, Audi, Daimler, Porsche, etc.), is looking for the production site in the Brașov Industrial Park in Ghimbav, for a :
 Transportation Management Specialist to support and optimize transportation and supply chain activities within our organization.
 Your Profile: 
University degree;
Previous experience in a similar role within the automotive industry;
Good understanding of logistics and transportation processes;
Strong analytical skills, with the ability to process and analyze complex information;
Good knowledge of SAP and MS Office applications (especially Excel and PowerPoint );
Knowledge of a transport management software;
Excellent communication and organizational skills;
Good English language skills.
 Key Responsibilities: 
Keep an overview on the procedures regarding transportation management;
Calculate, monitor, and analyze transportation costs;
Provide transportation-related support for new business and sales projects;
Manage improvement projects on the topic;
Offer global solutions regarding transport management;
Ensure effective time management for ongoing projects;
Participate in strategic projects aimed at securing and improving global supply chain processes;
Support the development and delivery of training materials and initiatives.
